# --- Never commit: these embed proprietary Command: Modern Operations data ---
# Any generated dashboard carries a full copy of the game database. This rule FAILS CLOSED:
# every .html is ignored and only the data-free template is allowed back in. The earlier
# version keyed on the "*_dashboard.html" naming convention, which a test build named
# anything else (aar_test.html) slipped straight past.
*.html
!*.template.html

# Game databases and any compressed copies
*.db3
*.db3.gz

# Game imagery (proprietary Slitherine/WarfareSims assets)
Images/
*.webp

# Raw JSON extracts from the database (also proprietary data)
*.json

# --- Local working documents (release packages, drafts) ---
RELEASE_*.md

# --- Python / PyInstaller build output ---
__pycache__/
*.pyc
build/
dist/
*.manifest

# --- Google Drive sync scratch files (repo lives in a Drive-synced folder) ---
.tmp.driveupload/
.tmp.drivedownload/

# --- OS / editor cruft ---
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
*~
.vscode/
.idea/
